  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "REGENT CREED",
   "text": "Governor… what if you're wrong?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep10/v31.wav",
   "d": 2.525,
   "e": "0000009zzvzvqc00bztvtgmywsxxqg8000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STERLING",
   "text": "Then history will call me a tyrant. But if I'm right, history won't call me anything at all. Because history requires disorder to be remembered.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep10/v32.wav",
   "d": 9.425,
   "e": "7xyuuzwvs00xzys0yuwwuyszw00rwstzxrzswyq0"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "somebody has to keep order",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/b8f0e175-7662-5188-a258-9146119a8114/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/13353462-0906-5774-8717-ce7dc53a717b.mp4",
   "in": 0.91,
   "d": 5.9,
   "said": "So let's go back to all of these jobs we've got to do in the airplane and put this in the correct order.",
   "src": "AOPA-ASF Single Pilot IFR",
   "y": 2007
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "No one votes. One by one, the Regents just say the words. From tonight, the myth will play before every broadcast in Texas.",
